<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets warrants on CS Holding.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets warrants on CS Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse (Zurich) said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on CS Holding registered shares.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    130 CHF		   PREMIUM	8.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.45 CHF		  GEARING	10.7 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.DEC.96-21.NOV.97   PAYDATE	02.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXHANGE	   MIN EXER LOT FIVE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  131.50 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
